{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1dcb51faef14007e","name":"Bryar Pistol","source":{"id":"source:reference-1dcb51faef14007e","title":"Bryar Pistol","revision":16402,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:50Z","sha256":"4d1d13fbcc192c21d392b755b886c45ca829fb957fe47305763d4d290cac89c1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16402","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bryar%20Pistol&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1dcb51faef14007e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Bryar Pistol is a cut-down version of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bryar Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bryar_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:acdbd2d1c071ec5a"},". Though it has less ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bryar Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bryar_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:acdbd2d1c071ec5a"}," (using standard Pistol ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranges"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranges"},") and deals slightly less damage, the Bryar Pistol is actually more manageable and accurate at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bryar Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bryar_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:acdbd2d1c071ec5a"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can prime a Bryar Pistol for a built-up shot. If you make no attacks with the Bryar Pistol before the start of your next turn, the next attack you make before the end of the encounter deals +1 die of damage and consumes 5 charges.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may not use any ability that consumes more than one shot (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"},") in conjunction with a primed shot. A Bryar Pistol requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 100 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be recharged.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,350\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 3 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Accurate:"]}," This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
